  "updatedAt": "2026-07-28T07:32:15.653Z",
  "description": "This change extends the TypeScript adapter (TypeScriptLanguageAdapter) in @specd/code-graph to extract symbols and relations from structural patterns in JavaScript/TypeScript (such as member assignments, object literal methods, CommonJS exports, class arrow fields, destructuring, and HOF initializers). By translating these dynamic, expression-based AST forms into standard SymbolKind kinds and RelationType relations, it ensures accurate code graph construction and blast-radius analyses for mixed/legacy projects without model schema changes or native memory regressions.",
